          "severity": "BLOCKER",
          "category": "bug",
          "title": "Re-check that a lead is still undecided before dismissing it",
          "body": "A lead qualified after the nightly refresh still has an open-items row and passes these checks: qualification changes `stage_id`, not `is_dismissed`. Consequently, running the cleanup dismisses a now-qualified deal and stamps it `backlog_cleanup_90d`. Re-check current candidate eligibility before updating the deal so decisions made since the refresh are preserved.",
