          "body": "Two simultaneous requests can both pass `find_active_payment_by_invoice`, `has_recent_unknown_charge`, and `_prior_charge_problem` before either reaches `_charge`. Both then charge the saved method, because the blocking payment row is written only afterward. The modal lock does not coordinate separate tabs or staff users. Although acknowledged in the description, this leaves a direct double-charge path in a money-moving endpoint. Acquire a cross-worker lock or atomic invoice reservation before the checks and retain protection through outcome recording.",
